rsfec -- systematic Reed-Solomon erasure coding over GF(256)
Copyright 2026 Denis Tishkov

Written with Claude (Anthropic).

This product includes software developed for a low-latency market-data
transport. The GF(256) kernels, the erasure codec and the HLS mirror are
original work licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The library has no third-party dependencies. Building the benchmarks
optionally uses Google Benchmark (Apache-2.0), which is not vendored here.
Building the HLS mirror's testbenches under csim uses the ap_int.h headers
shipped with AMD/Xilinx Vitis HLS, which are not redistributed here.
